{"release":{"id":354868023,"tag":"0.2.1","author":"zhu-han","name":"0.2.1","draft":false,"prerelease":false,"createdAt":"2026-07-16T04:45:45Z","publishedAt":"2026-07-16T04:47:24Z","markdown":"## What's Changed\r\n* Add audio.cpp to community projects by @0xShug0 in https://github.com/k2-fsa/OmniVoice/pull/209\r\n* Make flex_attention honor autocast (fixes silent fp32 attention, ~4x training slowdown) by @shuaills in https://github.com/k2-fsa/OmniVoice/pull/212\r\n* Honor asr_model_name when the ASR model is loaded lazily by @HenryVarro666 in https://github.com/k2-fsa/OmniVoice/pull/221\r\n* Add VoiceClonePrompt.save()/load() for cross-session voice reuse by @HenryVarro666 in https://github.com/k2-fsa/OmniVoice/pull/223\r\n* Fix ASR model always loading on GPU 0; add asr_device option by @HenryVarro666 in https://github.com/k2-fsa/OmniVoice/pull/224\r\n* Avoid decoding the full reference audio just to get its duration by @aradix85 in https://github.com/k2-fsa/OmniVoice/pull/220\r\n* Add opt-in text normalization (numbers, dates, currency) via generate(normalize_text=True) by @HenryVarro666 in https://github.com/k2-fsa/OmniVoice/pull/227\r\n* Add stale issue workflow by @zhu-han in https://github.com/k2-fsa/OmniVoice/pull/228\r\n\r\n## New Contributors\r\n* @0xShug0 made their first contribution in https://github.com/k2-fsa/OmniVoice/pull/209\r\n* @shuaills made their first contribution in https://github.com/k2-fsa/OmniVoice/pull/212\r\n* @HenryVarro666 made their first contribution in https://github.com/k2-fsa/OmniVoice/pull/221\r\n* @aradix85 made their first contribution in https://github.com/k2-fsa/OmniVoice/pull/220\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/k2-fsa/OmniVoice/compare/0.2.0...0.2.1","html":"<div class=\"markdown-heading\"><h2 class=\"heading-element\">What's Changed</h2><a id=\"user-content-whats-changed\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: What's Changed\" href=\"#whats-changed\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\"></span></a></div>\n<ul>\n<li>Add audio.cpp to community projects by @0xShug0 in <a href=\"https://github.com/k2-fsa/OmniVoice/pull/209\">https://github.com/k2-fsa/OmniVoice/pull/209</a>\n</li>\n<li>Make flex_attention honor autocast (fixes silent fp32 attention, ~4x training slowdown) by @shuaills in <a href=\"https://github.com/k2-fsa/OmniVoice/pull/212\">https://github.com/k2-fsa/OmniVoice/pull/212</a>\n</li>\n<li>Honor asr_model_name when the ASR model is loaded lazily by @HenryVarro666 in <a href=\"https://github.com/k2-fsa/OmniVoice/pull/221\">https://github.com/k2-fsa/OmniVoice/pull/221</a>\n</li>\n<li>Add VoiceClonePrompt.save()/load() for cross-session voice reuse by @HenryVarro666 in <a href=\"https://github.com/k2-fsa/OmniVoice/pull/223\">https://github.com/k2-fsa/OmniVoice/pull/223</a>\n</li>\n<li>Fix ASR model always loading on GPU 0; add asr_device option by @HenryVarro666 in <a href=\"https://github.com/k2-fsa/OmniVoice/pull/224\">https://github.com/k2-fsa/OmniVoice/pull/224</a>\n</li>\n<li>Avoid decoding the full reference audio just to get its duration by @aradix85 in <a href=\"https://github.com/k2-fsa/OmniVoice/pull/220\">https://github.com/k2-fsa/OmniVoice/pull/220</a>\n</li>\n<li>Add opt-in text normalization (numbers, dates, currency) via generate(normalize_text=True) by @HenryVarro666 in <a href=\"https://github.com/k2-fsa/OmniVoice/pull/227\">https://github.com/k2-fsa/OmniVoice/pull/227</a>\n</li>\n<li>Add stale issue workflow by @zhu-han in <a href=\"https://github.com/k2-fsa/OmniVoice/pull/228\">https://github.com/k2-fsa/OmniVoice/pull/228</a>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\"><h2 class=\"heading-element\">New Contributors</h2><a id=\"user-content-new-contributors\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: New Contributors\" href=\"#new-contributors\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\"></span></a></div>\n<ul>\n<li>@0xShug0 made their first contribution in <a href=\"https://github.com/k2-fsa/OmniVoice/pull/209\">https://github.com/k2-fsa/OmniVoice/pull/209</a>\n</li>\n<li>@shuaills made their first contribution in <a href=\"https://github.com/k2-fsa/OmniVoice/pull/212\">https://github.com/k2-fsa/OmniVoice/pull/212</a>\n</li>\n<li>@HenryVarro666 made their first contribution in <a href=\"https://github.com/k2-fsa/OmniVoice/pull/221\">https://github.com/k2-fsa/OmniVoice/pull/221</a>\n</li>\n<li>@aradix85 made their first contribution in <a href=\"https://github.com/k2-fsa/OmniVoice/pull/220\">https://github.com/k2-fsa/OmniVoice/pull/220</a>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Full Changelog</strong>: <a href=\"https://github.com/k2-fsa/OmniVoice/compare/0.2.0...0.2.1\">https://github.com/k2-fsa/OmniVoice/compare/0.2.0...0.2.1</a></p>\n","assets":[]}}